{"title":"어린 남편 [19세 완전판]","thumbnail":null,"synopsis":"은솔은 정략결혼 상대였던 한 회장이 죽었다는 소식과 함께그의 아들인 현오에게 종이 한 장을 건네받는다.“상대만 바꿔서 결혼을 하는 게 어떨까 싶은데. 이은솔 씨 생각은 어떻습니까?”“……저도 좋아요.”아버지가 계획한 계약 결혼을 망칠 수 없었던 은솔은갑작스러운 현오의 제안을 수락하고 결혼 생활을 시작하는데.‘……좋아해요, 현오 씨.’동거를 하며 현오를 향한 은솔의 사랑은 점점 커지지만늘 차가운 표정과 태도로 대하는 현오를 보며 은솔은 마음을 숨긴다.그렇게 대외적이고 잔잔한 결혼 생활을 보내던 중 은솔이 사라져 버린다.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-09-04","rank":268,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-05","rank":172,"change":{"type":"up","amount":96}},{"date":"2026-09-06","rank":94,"change":{"type":"up","amount":78}},{"date":"2026-09-07","rank":141,"change":{"type":"down","amount":47}},{"date":"2026-09-08","rank":166,"change":{"type":"down","amount":25}},{"date":"2026-09-09","rank":179,"change":{"type":"down","amount":13}},{"date":"2026-09-11","rank":252,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-15","rank":240,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-30","rank":173,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-01","rank":152,"change":{"type":"up","amount":21}},{"date":"2026-10-03","rank":188,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}}],"weekly":[{"date":"2026-09-05","rank":215,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-06","rank":181,"change":{"type":"up","amount":34}},{"date":"2026-09-07","rank":166,"change":{"type":"up","amount":15}},{"date":"2026-09-08","rank":164,"change":{"type":"up","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-09-09","rank":202,"change":{"type":"down","amount":38}},{"date":"2026-09-10","rank":159,"change":{"type":"up","amount":43}},{"date":"2026-09-11","rank":170,"change":{"type":"down","amount":11}},{"date":"2026-09-12","rank":245,"change":{"type":"down","amount":75}}],"monthly":[]},"viewSeries":[],"metricsSeries":[{"date":"2026-10-07","v":1675,"rc":0,"rs":0,"cc":3},{"date":"2026-10-08","v":1676,"rc":0,"rs":0,"cc":3},{"date":"2026-10-09","v":1678,"rc":0,"rs":0,"cc":3},{"date":"2026-10-10","v":1678,"rc":0,"rs":0,"cc":3}]}